/.quarto/
*.pyc

/.luarc.json

**/*.quarto_ipynb

_quarto_internal_scss_error.scss
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

_freeze/
.vscode/

# scratch output dir for single-section preview renders, e.g.
# quarto preview _SECTION_foo.qmd --output-dir _preview
_preview/

_SECTION_*.html

# Root-level only: the leading slashes matter. Unanchored, `slides_files/`
# also matches docs/slides_files/ and silently drops each render's new
# content-hashed theme CSS from commits, so the published deck loses its
# styling (theme 404s on GitHub Pages).
/_SECTION_*/
/slides_files/
/slides_nhs_oa_files/

# `quarto preview slides.qmd` / `slides_nhs_oa.qmd` (and VS Code's Preview
# button) render without --output-dir, so each deck's `output-file:` lands
# here at the root as a stray copy. Root-anchored for the same reason as
# above: the published decks are docs/index.html and
# docs_nhs_oa/index_nhs_oa.html, which must stay tracked.
/index.html
/index_nhs_oa.html

solutions/*
!solutions/.gitkeep
